19
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,060
I'm really sorry.

20
00:03:34,370 --> 00:03:35,170
All right.

21
00:03:35,700 --> 00:03:36,460
Let's just let it go this time

22
00:03:36,460 --> 00:03:37,750
since we were lucky.

23
00:03:37,970 --> 00:03:38,630
Don't worry.

24
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:39,800
I'll learn from this.

25
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,410
Something like this

26
00:03:40,410 --> 00:03:41,310
won't happen again.

27
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:42,520
I'm sorry. Let's go.

28
00:03:56,790 --> 00:03:57,660
Thanks...

29
00:03:58,690 --> 00:04:00,820
for coming all the way out here so late.

30
00:04:03,350 --> 00:04:04,810
I came because I wanted to.

31
00:04:06,870 --> 00:04:07,680
Anyway,

32
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:10,220
