33
00:04:13,410 --> 00:04:15,860
I need to go
to the third floor to get some documents.

34
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:17,570
Can you come with me?

35
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,300
Yeah.

36
00:05:09,930 --> 00:05:11,600
It's too dark here.

37
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:12,890
I can't see clearly,

38
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:15,100
and we'll have to go downstairs

39
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:16,370
in a bit.

40
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,040
Alright.

41
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,870
Is your car parked

42
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:01,100
at the school gate?

43
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:04,180
Yes.

44
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:06,570
I'll walk you to your car, then.

45
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:50,190
Fu Shize.

46
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:56,760
This is for you.

47
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:17,760
♪ It's as if I hear a voice ♪

48
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:20,790
♪ Telling me to bravely follow my heart ♪

49
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:25,110
♪ Until you came along ♪

50
00:07:25,130 --> 00:07:28,760
♪ And made my heart skip a beat ♪

51
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:33,050
♪ Not much has to be said ♪

52
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:36,409
♪ One look is all it takes ♪

53
00:07:38,130 --> 00:07:40,130
♪ That distant silhouette ♪

54
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:44,409
♪ Became crystal clear in this moment ♪

55
00:07:45,830 --> 00:07:49,300
♪ I know those fears ♪

56
00:07:49,330 --> 00:07:52,240
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

57
00:07:53,790 --> 00:07:56,620
♪ But I still believe ♪

58
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,270
No need

59
00:07:56,650 --> 00:07:59,340
♪ That we'll meet someday ♪

60
00:08:01,730 --> 00:08:03,310
♪ It's you ♪

61
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:05,640
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

62
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:07,190
♪ Just you ♪

63
00:08:07,210 --> 00:08:09,580
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

64
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,980
♪ This moon tonight ♪

65
00:08:11,010 --> 00:08:13,240
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

66
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:16,570
♪ And keeps me company through
the endless night ♪

67
00:08:17,010 --> 00:08:18,690
♪ It's you ♪

68
00:08:18,710 --> 00:08:20,870
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

69
00:08:20,910 --> 00:08:21,940
♪ Just you ♪

70
00:08:22,210 --> 00:08:24,550
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

71
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:24,770
You went out

72
00:08:24,690 --> 00:08:26,100
♪ By your side ♪

73
00:08:24,770 --> 00:08:26,270
and got chilled because of me.

74
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,110
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

75
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:28,180
If you don't accept it,

76
00:08:27,130 --> 00:08:29,480
♪ Feel warm again ♪

77
00:08:28,690 --> 00:08:30,040
I'll feel guilty.

78
00:08:30,530 --> 00:08:32,940
♪ It's you ♪

79
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,100
If you refuse again,

80
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:32,909
I'll take off my coat

81
00:08:32,909 --> 00:08:33,620
