582
00:33:06,670 --> 00:33:08,130
Sorry to keep you waiting.

583
00:33:08,200 --> 00:33:09,380
We arrived early.

584
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:19,680
Yun Li,

585
00:33:20,090 --> 00:33:21,480
can I call you that?

586
00:33:24,140 --> 00:33:25,140
I heard from Yunyi

587
00:33:25,570 --> 00:33:27,090
that you graduated from NUST.

588
00:33:27,090 --> 00:33:28,530
I graduated from NUST

589
00:33:28,530 --> 00:33:29,590
two years ago, too.

590
00:33:29,940 --> 00:33:31,270
Oh, so you're my senior.

591
00:33:32,240 --> 00:33:33,040
Yes, Li.

592
00:33:33,270 --> 00:33:34,030
My brother went to grad school

593
00:33:34,030 --> 00:33:35,110
at NUST.

594
00:33:42,290 --> 00:33:43,740
I didn't know what you like,

595
00:33:43,740 --> 00:33:44,500
so I took the liberty

596
00:33:44,500 --> 00:33:46,160
of ordering you an Americano.

597
00:33:46,460 --> 00:33:47,370
Thank you.

598
00:33:49,070 --> 00:33:49,680
Yunyi,

599
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:52,030
this is what Yun Ye

600
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:53,110
asked me to bring to you.

601
00:33:53,110 --> 00:33:54,370
Sorry for the trouble.

602
00:33:55,790 --> 00:33:57,180
Yun Ye said my classmates

603
00:33:57,180 --> 00:33:59,180
spent a long time making it.

604
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:00,580
He was afraid of breaking it,

605
00:34:00,580 --> 00:34:02,400
so he asked Li to bring it over.

606
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:03,800
Thank you, Li.

607
00:34:04,330 --> 00:34:06,290
Thanks for going out
of your way to bring it over.

608
00:34:06,290 --> 00:34:07,290
Don't mention it.

609
00:34:07,940 --> 00:34:09,380
So your classmates

610
00:34:09,380 --> 00:34:10,510
made this together?

611
00:34:13,300 --> 00:34:14,000
By the way,

612
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,730
Yun Li,

613
00:34:15,030 --> 00:34:16,480
what is your major?

614
00:34:16,670 --> 00:34:17,480
Automation.

615
00:34:18,340 --> 00:34:19,530
It's quite rare for girls

616
00:34:19,530 --> 00:34:20,630
to study science and engineering.

617
00:34:20,630 --> 00:34:21,630
There are even fewer

618
00:34:21,630 --> 00:34:22,690
girls at NUST.

619
00:34:23,090 --> 00:34:23,800
Actually, these days,

620
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:25,670
lots of girls are choosing science
and engineering majors.

621
00:34:25,670 --> 00:34:26,340
Really?

622
00:34:25,840 --> 00:34:27,510
[For Yunyi, Class 5, Grade 11]

623
00:34:29,900 --> 00:34:30,630
By the way,

624
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:32,280
how are you settling in here

625
00:34:32,280 --> 00:34:33,190
after coming from Xifu?

626
00:34:33,190 --> 00:34:33,880
Do you like

627
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:34,880
the food here?

628
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:36,230
It's okay.

629
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:42,280
Welcome.

630
00:34:45,170 --> 00:34:45,800
Excuse me,

631
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:47,570
do you have any cakes that
would make a nice gift for a girl?

632
00:34:47,570 --> 00:34:49,030
Is it for your girlfriend?

633
00:34:49,070 --> 00:34:50,590
You can take a look at these.

634
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,980
They are all our popular items.

635
00:34:51,980 --> 00:34:52,969
They sell very well.

636
00:34:52,969 --> 00:34:54,300
Girls really like them.

637
00:34:54,610 --> 00:34:56,340
This is our newest

638
00:34:56,370 --> 00:34:57,760
matcha cake.

639
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:01,690
I'll take this one.

640
00:35:01,690 --> 00:35:02,280
Okay.

641
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:03,410
I'll pack it for you.

642
00:35:13,730 --> 00:35:15,510
Hello, the number you have dialed

643
00:35:15,510 --> 00:35:16,780
is busy now.

644
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:18,380
Could he be busy

645
00:35:18,380 --> 00:35:19,510
with work right now?

646
00:35:49,620 --> 00:35:50,160
Uncle.

647
00:35:50,820 --> 00:35:51,500
Uncle.

648
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:56,900
Why are you here?

649
00:35:56,980 --> 00:35:57,780
Qingsong,

650
00:35:57,780 --> 00:35:58,940
you came just in time.

651
00:35:58,940 --> 00:36:01,200
I've got something juicy for you to hear.

652
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:02,940
I posted online

653
00:36:03,940 --> 00:36:05,730
that she slept her way

654
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:08,440
to the top by seducing Fu Shize.

655
00:36:08,460 --> 00:36:09,980
This is what happens

656
00:36:10,070 --> 00:36:11,440
when she crosses me.

657
00:36:12,090 --> 00:36:15,530
I want to ruin her reputation

658
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:18,030
and make sure she can't
work in this industry again.

659
00:36:18,030 --> 00:36:18,610
You...

660
00:36:27,590 --> 00:36:29,320
Then I'll go pay the bill first.

661
00:36:35,340 --> 00:36:36,280
Lili,

662
00:36:36,630 --> 00:36:37,300
thank you

663
00:36:37,300 --> 00:36:39,130
for going out of your way
to bring me the gift.

664
00:36:39,130 --> 00:36:40,090
It's nothing.

665
00:36:40,090 --> 00:36:41,230
Don't be so polite.

666
00:36:42,940 --> 00:36:43,460
Yunyi..

667
00:36:44,130 --> 00:36:45,230
You just transferred here,

668
00:36:45,230 --> 00:36:46,780
so make sure you focus on your studies.

669
00:36:46,780 --> 00:36:47,800
I'll tell Yun Ye

670
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,000
not to bother you so much.

671
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:50,800
Your studies should come first.

672
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:01,010
I'll give you a ride.

673
00:37:01,070 --> 00:37:01,800
No need.

674
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:02,530
I can go—

675
00:37:02,630 --> 00:37:03,750
It's okay, Li.

676
00:37:04,380 --> 00:37:05,340
Sorry to trouble you today.

677
00:37:05,340 --> 00:37:07,270
Just let my brother give you a ride.

678
00:37:08,820 --> 00:37:09,860
Then thank you.

679
00:37:16,260 --> 00:37:17,710
This is what happens

680
00:37:17,860 --> 00:37:19,210
when she crosses me.

681
00:37:19,940 --> 00:37:23,380
I want to ruin her reputation

682
00:37:23,690 --> 00:37:25,590
and make sure she can't
work in this industry again.

683
00:37:25,590 --> 00:37:26,690
How about this?

684
00:37:27,190 --> 00:37:29,440
We don't want this turning
into an even bigger scandal.

685
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:32,240
Feifei, we're putting you
on unpaid leave for now.

686
00:37:32,670 --> 00:37:33,790
How can an intern

687
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:35,340
be put on unpaid leave?

688
00:37:35,340 --> 00:37:36,140
What the hell?

689
00:37:37,130 --> 00:37:37,780
The company

690
00:37:37,780 --> 00:37:39,490
has to consider the fallout, too.

691
00:37:39,490 --> 00:37:40,640
This unpaid leave

692
00:37:40,670 --> 00:37:41,880
is only temporary.

693
00:37:41,940 --> 00:37:43,470
We'll decide what to do next

694
00:37:43,670 --> 00:37:45,240
once the investigation is complete.

695
00:37:45,240 --> 00:37:47,900
This is the fairest way
to handle things for now.

696
00:37:48,380 --> 00:37:49,940
Everything I said is true.

697
00:37:50,570 --> 00:37:51,940
That's just how she is.

698
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,630
I didn't lie.

699
00:37:54,380 --> 00:37:56,000
Now you're playing the victim?

700
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:56,730
I don't care.

701
00:37:56,730 --> 00:37:58,530
You'd better explain yourself.

702
00:37:58,540 --> 00:37:59,770
Otherwise, I'll make sure you
trend online!

703
00:37:59,770 --> 00:38:01,370
I'll post your video online!

704
00:38:04,250 --> 00:38:06,250
Given the circumstances,

705
00:38:06,590 --> 00:38:08,300
the facts are pretty clear at this point.

706
00:38:08,300 --> 00:38:10,230
To prevent this from escalating further

707
00:38:10,230 --> 00:38:12,280
and to give everyone an explanation,

708
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,070
Du Gefei,

709
00:38:13,500 --> 00:38:14,530
you need to record

710
00:38:14,530 --> 00:38:15,900
a sincere apology video

711
00:38:15,900 --> 00:38:16,900
and post it online

712
00:38:17,030 --> 00:38:18,490
to explain what happened.

713
00:38:18,670 --> 00:38:19,380
This is

714
00:38:19,380 --> 00:38:21,030
the most effective

715
00:38:21,500 --> 00:38:23,700
and sensible way for you to handle this.

716
00:38:25,980 --> 00:38:27,110
Let's do it this way.

717
00:38:33,900 --> 00:38:34,440
I... I...

718
00:38:34,440 --> 00:38:35,970
You can drop me off up ahead.

719
00:38:38,690 --> 00:38:39,500
Li.

720
00:38:39,690 --> 00:38:42,290
What time does Yun Ye usually
get out of school?

721
00:38:43,260 --> 00:38:45,520
He usually gets home around six or seven,

722
00:38:45,530 --> 00:38:47,060
unless something comes up.

723
00:38:48,750 --> 00:38:49,550
I'll be going.

724
00:38:51,570 --> 00:38:52,320
Thank you.

725
00:38:55,110 --> 00:38:55,800
See you next time, Yunyi.

726
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:56,930
Thanks for the gift.

727
00:38:58,110 --> 00:38:58,730
Sorry.

728
00:38:58,780 --> 00:39:00,310
What was that you just said?

729
00:39:11,350 --> 00:39:15,010
♪ Dust upon time ♪

730
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:18,400
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

731
00:39:20,210 --> 00:39:23,390
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

732
00:39:24,320 --> 00:39:27,710
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

733
00:39:28,170 --> 00:39:29,090
Why are you here?

734
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:32,660
♪ Wind brushes the half-drawn curtain ♪

735
00:39:31,230 --> 00:39:32,380
I tried calling you.

736
00:39:33,060 --> 00:39:36,710
♪ Carrying away unneeded words ♪

737
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:35,630
My phone was in my bag.

738
00:39:35,630 --> 00:39:37,090
I probably didn't hear it.

739
00:39:37,130 --> 00:39:41,200
♪ Is it true that the more we wish
for what we want ♪

740
00:39:38,230 --> 00:39:39,900
Have you been waiting for me?

741
00:39:41,220 --> 00:39:45,460
♪ The more we tend to fall short? ♪

742
00:39:43,550 --> 00:39:44,190
Well...

743
00:39:44,960 --> 00:39:46,090
The scarf...

744
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:49,960
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

745
00:39:50,140 --> 00:39:53,710
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

746
00:39:54,090 --> 00:39:54,550
Here you go.

747
00:39:54,320 --> 00:39:58,210
♪ Does the fading light ♪

748
00:39:58,240 --> 00:40:02,290
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

749
00:39:58,380 --> 00:39:59,460
You can keep it on.

750
00:39:59,460 --> 00:40:00,460
I'm okay, thanks.

751
00:40:02,690 --> 00:40:03,590
Thanks for the scarf.

752
00:40:03,070 --> 00:40:07,110
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

753
00:40:07,130 --> 00:40:10,890
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

754
00:40:11,570 --> 00:40:15,390
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

755
00:40:12,010 --> 00:40:12,460
Hey.

756
00:40:15,420 --> 00:40:19,830
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

757
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:17,170
Okay.

758
00:40:17,170 --> 00:40:18,300
I'll be right there.

759
00:40:21,130 --> 00:40:26,220
♪ Half the tale remains ♪
